OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvercast throughout the day
OL,6,Fwith very few patches of blue sky. It
OL,7,Fshould remain generally dry except for
OL,8,Fa very light sprinkle of rain at times
OL,9,Ffurther east. Feeling cool, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures near the seasonal average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy and calm. Spells of
OL,13,Flight rain and drizzle will be mainly
OL,14,Ffocused on the North Pennines, so it
OL,15,Fwill be generally dry elsewhere. A
OL,16,Fcolder night than Friday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
