OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FMostly cloudy further north,
OL,6,Fwith the best of the bright spells
OL,7,Faround Cheshire. Cool, calm and dry,
OL,8,Fwith clear spells lengthening into the
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FFog
OL,12,Fand frost on Monday morning, then
OL,13,Fsunny. A cold start again on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fand cloud will gradually thicken ahead
OL,15,Fof overnight rain. Milder, wetter and
OL,16,Fbreezier on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
